// A planted fishery for STOCKS, CHANCES AND ACCOUNTS (profile 1.14, after Banitz et al. 2022,
// Hertz et al. 2024 and Martinez Pena et al. 2023): a stock that births add to and a catch drains,
// with a loop that runs through the inflow; a step that makes collapse likelier rather than more;
// an account of causation on the map and one on a chain, each held against what the map shows; and
// a step found in one case and also claimed in general -- an extrapolation.
===
title: "Stocks -- a planted fishery"
mechanism:
    question: "Why did the fishery collapse?"
    account: [regularity, intra-action]
    levels: [fishery, boats]
    ordering: composition
    within: {boats: fishery}
    actors:
        fishery: {label: "The fishery", level: fishery}
        boats:   {label: "The boats", level: boats}
    states:
        births:     {label: "Fish born each year", actor: fishery, aspect: quantity}
        population: {label: "The fish population", actor: fishery, aspect: quantity}
        catch:      {label: "Fish caught each year", actor: boats, aspect: quantity}
        collapse:   {label: "The fishery collapses", actor: fishery, aspect: event, role: outcome}
        quota:      {label: "A catch quota", actor: fishery, role: intervention}
    chains:
        policy:
            label: "Quota and catch"
            question: "Does a quota cut the catch?"
            account: manipulability
===

[Births add to the stock]: The fish born each year add to the population.
    {causes: {from: births, to: population, sign: "+", on: stock, basis: asserted}}

[The stock breeds]: The more fish there are, the more are born.
    {causes: {from: population, to: births, sign: "+", basis: asserted}}

[The catch drains the stock]: The catch takes fish out of the population.
    {causes: {from: catch, to: population, sign: "-", on: stock, basis: asserted}}

[A thin stock risks collapse]: A thinner population raises the risk that the fishery collapses.
    {causes: {from: population, to: collapse, sign: "-", on: chance, basis: statistics}}

[The quota cut this catch]: In this bay the quota cut the catch.
    {causes: {from: quota, to: catch, sign: "-", basis: example, scope: singular, chain: policy}}

[Quotas cut catches]: Quotas cut catches.
    {causes: {from: quota, to: catch, sign: "-", basis: asserted, scope: general, chain: policy}}
